{"id":"u-cf98a60e-4e68-49d6-aa34-14eb8dc7b5ba","src":"community","title":"PHUL Forge 🔥","author":"Justin R","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/leeA9i-phul","desc":"PHUL Forge is a progressive strength-to-hypertrophy program designed to build power and size over 12 weeks. The first 6 weeks focus on unilateral strength work to eliminate imbalances and develop raw power. The next 6 weeks transition to bilateral training to maximize muscle growth and volume tolerance.\n\nDURING THE FIRST 6 WEEKS OF UNILATERAL TRAINING - ALWAYS START WITH YOUR WEAKEST SIDE FIRST AND THEN MATCH THAT REP COUNT WITH YOUR STRONGER SIDE EVEN IF YOU FEEL LIKE YOU CAN DO MORE ON YOUR STRONGER SIDE! This is how we'll address muscle imbalances, otherwise you'll make the problem worse.\n\n🔥 Rest Periods:\n⏳ Strength Days – 60-90 sec (enough to maintain intensity while keeping sessions efficient).\n⏳ Hypertrophy Days – 60 sec max (driving metabolic stress and muscle endurance).\n\nThis program bridges the gap between strength and size, ensuring balanced development, progressive overload, and non-stop gains. 💪🚀","level":["Intermediate","Advanced","Beginner"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength","Women's"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T03:27:33.228Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper Strength","Lower Strength","Upper Hypertrophy","Lower Hypertrophy"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Alternating Incline Dumbbell Chest Press (Bottom Hold)","sets":[{"lo":3,"hi":6,"x":4}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":3,"hi":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Single Arm Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":3,"hi":6,"x":4}]},{"n":"Pullover (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":3,"hi":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Alternating Arnold Press","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Single Arm Rear Delt Cable Fly","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Alternating Skull Crush (Top Hold)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Alternating Dumbbell Curl","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Shrug (